This directory holds the site's secrets on the KSA host only (git-ignored; see deploy/README.md "Secrets").
Directory mode 0700, owner root. Files, one value each, no trailing spaces:
  django_secret_key  db_superuser_password  db_owner_password  db_app_password  db_backup_password
  db_monitor_password  hr_personal_data_keys  hr_personal_data_hash_key  banking_data_keys  web_mfa_keys
  backup-recipients.txt (age PUBLIC keys)  smtp_password  grafana_admin_password
  openbao_backup_token  openbao_erp_role_id  openbao_erp_secret_id   (written by openbao/bootstrap.sh)
  openbao_retire_role_id  openbao_retire_secret_id                   (written by openbao/bootstrap.sh)
  tls/erp.crt  tls/erp.key                (public certificate chain and key for ALMIRAS_DOMAIN)
  openbao-tls/server.crt  openbao-tls/server.key  openbao-tls/ca.crt   (internal CA)
